---
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-24 text-center">
  <p class="reveal chapter-tag mb-8 text-sm">第四章 · 许愿</p>

  <h2 class="reveal text-glow mb-4 text-4xl md:text-5xl" data-annotation="underline">
    吹灭蜡烛，许个愿吧
  </h2>

  <p class="reveal mb-10 max-w-md text-lg text-foam/80">
    这盏手绘的蜡烛不会熄灭——除非你亲手把它吹灭。点击蜡烛，许下你的生日愿望。
  </p>

  <!-- 手绘蛋糕 + 蜡烛 -->
  <button id="candle" type="button" class="reveal outline-none" aria-label="点击吹灭蜡烛">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 230" class="h-64 w-auto md:h-80" fill="none">
      <!-- 蜡烛 -->
      <rect x="94" y="66" width="12" height="46" rx="2" fill="#ffd98a" stroke="#d9a85f" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="100" y1="72" x2="100" y2="108" stroke="#d9a85f" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <!-- 火焰 -->
      <g id="flame" class="flame">
        <path d="M100 40 Q91 52 100 63 Q109 52 100 40 Z" fill="#ffb347" stroke="#ff8f6b" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <ellipse cx="100" cy="51" rx="2.6" ry="4.2" fill="#fff6de" />
      </g>
      <!-- 蛋糕第一层 -->
      <rect x="62" y="112" width="76" height="26" rx="5" fill="#f7c8d8" stroke="#d99aaf" stroke-width="2" />
      <circle cx="80" cy="125" r="3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.8" />
      <circle cx="100" cy="125" r="3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.8" />
      <circle cx="120" cy="125" r="3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.8" />
      <!-- 蛋糕第二层 -->
      <rect x="50" y="138" width="100" height="28" rx="5" fill="#c9e4f0" stroke="#8fb7cc" stroke-width="2" />
      <circle cx="75" cy="152" r="3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.7" />
      <circle cx="100" cy="152" r="3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.7" />
      <circle cx="125" cy="152" r="3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.7" />
      <!-- 蛋糕第三层 -->
      <rect x="38" y="166" width="124" height="30" rx="5" fill="#ffe0b8" stroke="#d9a85f" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="M48 180 q8 8 16 0 M78 180 q8 8 16 0 M108 180 q8 8 16 0" stroke="#d9a85f" stroke-width="2" fill="none" />
    </svg>
  </button>

  <!-- 吹灭后浮现的祝福 -->
  <div id="wish-reveal" class="hidden mt-10 space-y-4">
    <p class="text-2xl text-gold" data-annotation="circle" data-color="#ffd98a">
      愿望一定会实现 ✨
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-foam/80">愿你许下的所有愿望，都像气泡一样，一个接一个地实现。</p>
  </div>
</section>
